---
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import PlayerComparison from '../../components/PlayerComparison.astro';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head><BaseHead title="Compare NBA shot mixes | Narayan Lekhi" description="Compare two players’ own historical shot mixes and supported relocation scenarios." /></head>
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main class="band">
      <div class="band-inner band-inner--wide at-edge">
        <p><a href="/projects/nba-shot-selection-analytics/">Return to the single-player explorer</a></p>
        <h1>Compare two shot mixes</h1>
        <p>These estimates compare each player with their own historical shot mix. They do not rank overall talent or prove that one player is a better shooter.</p>
        <p>Choose two players in one season. A shared slider and court view keep the scenario aligned. Changing either player or the season resets relocation to 0%.</p>
        <PlayerComparison />
      </div>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
